{"overview":"Mystery writer Cornelia Van Gorder has rented a country house called \"The Oaks\", which not long ago was the scene of some murders committed by a strange and violent criminal known as \"The Bat\". Meanwhile, the house's owner, bank president John Fleming, has recently embezzled one million dollars in securities and has hidden the proceeds in the house, but is killed before he can retrieve it.","tagline":"When it flies... someone dies!","cast":[{"n":"Vincent Price","c":"Dr. Malcolm Wells","p":"/7JIv7U5kwveryP7hrPYgHlKea4d.jpg","q":"Q219640"},{"n":"Agnes Moorehead","c":"Cornelia van Gorder","p":"/h9vMkb6cjd5J3i0GCQ0t73DlQl0.jpg","q":"Q231221"},{"n":"Gavin Gordon","c":"Lt. Andy Anderson","p":"/tYvd7597PsD86VyLXzLGhdHLm9F.jpg","q":"Q3758989"},{"n":"John Sutton","c":"Warner, the Chauffeur","p":"/jdghkEOavykFhmI1kzjsDDDJLmN.jpg","q":"Q1701859"},{"n":"Lenita Lane","c":"Lizzie Allen","p":"/2Fn4SUypNroUln7Dkqu7TQocRKl.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Elaine Edwards","c":"Dale Bailey","p":"/gdyAlwkcovJhPXQbphpBfZRyZRC.jpg","q":"Q273905"},{"n":"Darla Hood","c":"Judy Hollander","p":"/nXqxSjQig8asRbeoqD9CCAC4k5u.jpg","q":"Q274081"},{"n":"John Bryant","c":"Mark Fleming","p":"/u1KPGVWjYpuksrl7gi3H9vQbdXs.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Harvey Stephens","c":"John Fleming","p":"/icshg5tTNkbiQtt4ivgsH0Dr06X.jpg","q":"Q3128047"},{"n":"Mike Steele","c":"Victor Bailey","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bat_(1959_film)","qid":"Q3224357"}